M2 Technical Report — CausalLOB
This report documents the technical foundation completed in Milestone 2 for my individual CSE 516 project. 
It covers the FI-2010 data pipeline, the final 39-parent-slot Dynamic Bayesian Network, LPCMCI-based structure learning, parameter learning for the frozen DBN, exact and approximate probabilistic inference under partial observation, the AR(5) baseline, and the first M2 KPI results.
The report also explains the conditional-independence assumptions, model factorization, SOTA positioning, limitations, and the handoff to M3.
